<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cifra upped.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cifra upped.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dresdner Kleinwort Benson said on Friday analyst Justin McGowan had raised his rating for Mexican retail chain Cifra SA de CV to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- In a March 5 report, McGowan said Cifra's fourth quarter earnings were well ahead of his forecast.</p>
<p>-- &quot;We are upgrading the stock to buy in the expectation of a powerful recovery in cash flow in H2 '97.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Cifra shares rose 0.20 peso to 12.70 pesos in Mexico City.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
</text>
